  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer planar dielectric stack on Si substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat) (alternating, starting with HfO2, 20 layers total). Optimize all 20 layer thicknesses individually. Target: maximize emissivity in 8000-13000 nm wavelength band, minimize emissivity in 3000-5000 nm wavelength band. Use thickness perturbation bound of ±0.15% and quadratic penalty weight of 0.025. Materials: hfo2, SiO2 (Kischkat), si. Total layer count must not exceed 24 (fixed at 20 for this route).",
